<description>&lt;p&gt;Explosives attacks on the Colombia-Venezuela border have again wounded police officers, with a bomb near Cúcuta’s main bridge and another blast injuring four officers. Former Cúcuta security chief Miguel Castellanos was shot dead in a political assassination. An extortion-linked assault in Colombia killed at least six people. The conflict recorded 225 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxNdUt6TllDZVlCNjFIZF9KS3Ywb2N3NFN1R1h1RS02WHpxbHBobHA0c1BqWE5GQjkwclF5RkZtenMxRmd5TVZOcE1XdVMzYURXeUhmcXdhbkFsWlV2ekNZclM1NWM5QXFSTzdFdzczSWY3eXdiQ0t3NWlZdnlBSTZJZy0zd3pDMjdGekZaUlpQcjJ1WkROeWRsT1QteVBybU5HdFVRUkdtSkR1ZHp4UVVNbXQybTJyRDg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Los Angeles Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Demócrata&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxQUS14YnE1YWlfUXpwNW5oVjRKbTVGR0ZOZmQ2eWZjRlhibG93MlV2SWhuQVQtc253OWNpeDFBRkdJRlpmZTMzOFZoeEo2cXVrMTVXZ3lOckZ0SHZqZ2I1cG1TM0tWRmVxYkJPcUc4SWhCNm1nci1yVV9WbDFsV09CYzZ0UC10OVBlSmFoa2J2bEg3OTFCcGc0N2ozdTJOZlpsZ2xB?oc=5&quot;&gt;ColombiaOne.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxONC1VSEtfUzlEWHd5Mm1adXBIWXVjOWYtZWNXQWR3Rms1MG5VR3JDUnd0STJmS3JQOHBQNGJTVnk0Qy01MFpUY0dhOFVpeVByTkpNWE91YUVHbFBnM01nN2NGZV9wUGkyR1R4U25yOW9SYmItelhTRlpkZ050dTZmZE1aZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Sun Malaysia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxOMXhFNXR2SWZUVWFHdGsyNldKaTR2SDFtZEF1MWlZZ3Rud25LaDAwNE9WX3dfU1V1dHZxaDhiRVlvTHNIVWt1WElaVC1BQzJwbDRkakZiMUxGQmZyTE9Yb2EydFFXeUJGbjJQVXNFVnNVN3d5cHhCQ0ZVdEp6M0xqUUE5VTdGUFk?oc=5&quot;&gt;Latest news from Azerbaijan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiekFVX3lxTE1kTTdGVGlFSVVwczZFX0huY3Q3c0RId2lHamxuc0hhX2dkTGl